<title>USA: Bufete gets $7.4 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Bufete gets $7.4 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bufete Industrial SA said on Thursday it had received a $7.4 million construction contract from Texas Instruments Inc's Mexican affiliate.</p>
<p>Mexico City-based Bufete will build the facility in Aguascalientes, Mexico, for the production of electrical and electronic components.</p>
<p>Bufete said the first phase of the plant will be completed by July 1997.</p>
</text>
